    {
        "text": "Are you from County Hillock?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you heard of any spectre force?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242"
    },
    {
        "text": "Spectre... what? *cough*, *cough* *cough*... Doesn't force mean people like you lot, all the soldiers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "They took Lowry, Julia and Chris away... is it\u2014is it my turn now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want you to calm down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen. We have people who saw a batch of Originium goods enter this warehouse late last night. And now, those goods aren't here. You need to give me an explanation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242"
    },
    {
        "text": "Explanation? That's what you're looking for? You're not going to just hang me? I\u2014I... *pteuch*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 10,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 0.51,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! What are you spittin' around for? You've gotta care about hygiene!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Any leads?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "None, it's potatoes everywhere. If our information wasn't wrong, then they must work a sight fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bring him. He definitely knows something, he's just not willing to open up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242"
    },
    {
        "text": "There it is... you're all the same! Dying to find faults in all of us, torturing us... you Victorian oppressor beasts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh? Again? He thinks callin' another Victorian 'Victorian' counts as an insult? It's flyin' over my head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Leader, incoming.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Triangle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How many?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Prepare to break up.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Yes, Leader.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 300,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -300,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Update, Leader, they seem to be our own.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Triangle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They're in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Leader, we're surrounded.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Going by the numbers, yes.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(If you listen to the voices, there don't seem to be too many left outside. If I crack the wall by me, then we've got our chance!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Don't get hasty.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see you've had a very fierce confrontation in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rita Skamandros, 7th Frontline Infantry Battalion, 2nd Tempest Platoon Leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nice to meet you, Lieutenant Skamm... Skamandros.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My name isn't too easy to remember. You can call me Horn, Captain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well, Horn. I'm Kelly, Louis Kelly. I'm sorry, codenames aren't our style.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain Kelly, you and your troops are presumably also here to investigate this warehouse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct, we've received the tip-off too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you ought to understand how grave this situation is. A great deal of illicit Originium goods were stolen off a military transport a couple months ago, and ultimately came to vanish in this region.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need not remind you, Captain, with this much ordnance, coupled with recent thefts in surrounding counties\u2014if fallen into felonious hands, the menace posed will reach far beyond County Hillock.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, thank you for the run-down. I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And we're very thankful for your cooperation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hill!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adjutant Hill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take this young man... this suspect back to camp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? It was mad for us gettin' this man as our lead!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, her spear is obstructing fulfillment of my duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adjutant Hill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bagpipe, let it go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "But our mission\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014We're on Hillock land right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain Kelly pulls a handkerchief from his pocket, and wipes the sweat on his forehead."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very glad we could persuade you, Lieutenant. You and this young Vouivre lady, and all others present...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem\u2014you must be certainly worn out by your hard journey, dashing here from Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's our duty as soldiers of Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, quite right. Now, if you still have intention to operate in County Hillock...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're obliged to continue tracking the thieved Originium goods. This is an order from Londinium. I imagine Colonel Hamilton would see sense too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, of course. You may accompany me back to camp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leader, do we really have to give him up to them? They have to be doin' this on purpose! Ever since we touched foot on the outskirt plate, they've been followin' right behind!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right until now, just as we caught him\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Stationed troops of the Empire have a responsibility to address any threat to public safety that arises within their station.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They haven't violated any code.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain, he's yours. As per code, we may also take part in the interrogation\u2014we hope you recall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha, hahah... yes, quite in line with code.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "N\u2014No... let me go! Don't take me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adjutant Hill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Help me... save my soul! I haven't done anything... I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.8,
        "xstrength": 50,
        "ystrength": 50,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaarghhh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicked Youth"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248",
        "name2": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": 1
    },
