    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": -300,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hill...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_248"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tara rabble like him always do make a scene like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Adjutant Hill"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_238"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take him away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Captain Kelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, really! What gives them the right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Leader, I think... that wee Feline wants us to help him. He's scared to death of goin' with them.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(......)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Triangle?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, Leader. Still in position, outside in the same tree. They haven't noticed me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Triangle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Good. Take the reconnaissance group, and keep investigating along nearby transport routes. If you find any leads, immediately report back.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Horn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_229_1#1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood. Are we notifying their barracks?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Triangle"
    },
